WEBVTT

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.360
Not many <i>kaiju </i>lately.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.700
Maybe there're <i>kaiju </i>seasons.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.540
Hot seasons, dry seasons,
harvest seasons...

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.540
Captain? What are you looking at?

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.910
Huh? Look.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.580
Huh? Hmm? What?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.000
Up!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.260
Up? O-Oh!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Which Memories Do You Regret?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Episode 10

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.670
A kite!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.010
24-Hour Yomotsu Food Service

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.010
First <i>kaiju </i>in a while.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.350
This one looks different.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:39.440
It's good. I was waiting
for one like this.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.230
Can I go for it?

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:42.400
Of course.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.650
Instance Dominat--

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:56.080
Huh? What the hell happened?
Mujina, what'd you do?!

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.290
She's gone.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.290
Huh?

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:00.370
She just vanished.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.170
Mujina! Where are--?!

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.630
Now everyone can be free.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.010
Who's flying it?

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.270
The family over there.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:19.730
It's so high.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.730
It takes a good grip.

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:23.150
Yeah?

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.190
I just made that up.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.190
Huh? What?

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.400
Well, it might.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.400
Huh?

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.150
Oh, it flew away.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.450
Gauma! Have you seen Minami?!

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.910
Huh? She's right there... or was.

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:39.330
Uh, I thought you were with her.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:46.710
Papa... Mama...

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:50.380
Is this a dream? What's going on?

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.470
Kano's alive?

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.100
Hey, what the hell?!

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.100
People are vanishing.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.270
Huh? Over there!

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:05.850
Shit! I knew it was a <i>kaiju</i>!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.320
So that's what took Minami?

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:10.940
Thank you.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.410
You're welcome. Was it good?

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:16.410
It was.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:20.790
That's good to hear!
It makes cooking worthwhile.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.330
Have I gone into the past?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:27.460
Kano, the dishes! And your bento box!

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:29.550
Hey, Kano!

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:37.010
What was I thinking back then?

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:41.810
Not good. Let's clean this <i>kaiju </i>up.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:45.480
But without Minami, we can't combine.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.400
This might be tough.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.520
Leave it to me.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:54.400
Yeah, whatever. Just be grateful
we're letting you--

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:56.530
Sorry!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.740
Knight, be careful.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:01.870
I know. You be careful, too.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.370
Knight!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.750
This is...

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:20.640
I know where Dyna Wing's at--
inside the <i>kaiju</i>.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.220
And Minami, too.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.470
Let's get her back!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.140
How?

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.390
By going through its mouth.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:35.740
I'll go in first. You guys wait until I--

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:36.570
Hmm?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.410
Gauma!

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:57.470
Well, I guess it's up to me.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:03:59.930
The others!

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.390
Chise, we've gotta go!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.680
But--!

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:09.940
I found it here. We could do
anything with this much.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:14.070
Koyomi, let's use it and go somewhere.

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:18.450
That's right... This is when I ran away.

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:19.740
Let's go!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.030
Let's go.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.080
Where am I?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.500
Gauma!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.710
Wh-Why are you guys here?!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.420
Dude, my clothes!

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.420
Excited much?

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.090
She's on her way.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.010
Huh? Who?

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.810
The princess is coming
to observe our work.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.720
Gauma, don't embarrass us.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:51.730
I see... Oh, yeah...

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:54.980
I wonder why she cares about <i>kaiju </i>users?

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.570
Beats me.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.150
Look.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.950
The princess has arrived.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.370
Princess!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.290
Ow, ow, ow!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:16.210
Is this inside the <i>kaiju</i>?

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.010
Gauma?! Huh?! What?!

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:25.140
Yomogi, there's someone
I want you to meet.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:26.050
Who?

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:30.020
It's a friend of mine named Kamijo.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:34.610
I was hoping you'd join us for dinner.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.610
Why didn't I just say no?

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:39.070
Dyna Soldier...

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:42.780
Oh, yeah. I'm looking for Minami!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:46.870
Dyna Soldier, show me the way!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.840
Minami!

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:12.390
Minami! What the hell is all this?

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:19.230
Why is it broken?

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.070
Oh...

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.960
Futaba and Kano?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.970
Is this Minami's past?

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.970
Goldburn. You protected us, didn't you?

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:57.440
Will Senpai and the others come back?

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:01.690
I think it all depends on them.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.160
Kano?

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.830
Dammit!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:21.300
What should I do, Dyna Soldier?

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:26.380
Kano, is chorus club fun?

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:32.970
Maybe I'll try it in high school.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.680
Suit yourself.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.990
You always say that.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:50.700
Hmm?

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.370
Huh? What?!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:01.250
Minami... Try to remember!

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.710
Yume.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:09.680
Yume, I'd like you to come.

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.970
Huh?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.260
To the chorus club's recital.

