00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.440
It's a promise, then.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.350
Yeah.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:24.730
What?

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:32.830
Never mind.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.860
I'm going out.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.570
Singing practice?

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:11.950
Yeah.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:14.580
Don't go somewhere dangerous.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.580
Like on the flood gate?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:20.000
Hey, don't you dare!

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.500
Kano!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.670
They say it was suicide.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:27.880
She died at that flood gate.

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:33.680
Minami, we've gotta
stop your sister! Otherwise...

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:39.770
Why can't I reach you?! At this rate--!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:45.020
At this rate, Minami will be sad! And I...

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:51.450
I... can't stand that!

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.120
Dyna Wing?

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.380
Yomogi!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.930
Minami...

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:18.260
Let's go stop your sister!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.020
Right!

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:25.850
♬ Now, ♬

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:30.860
♬ go and soar. ♬

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:37.370
♬ On the winds ♬

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:41.580
♬ called hope. ♬

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.580
Kano! Kano! Kano!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.090
Kano!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.500
Please don't die!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.470
Huh?

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:58.680
I know everything!

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:02.770
I know you're dating Futaba
and that you're being bullied!

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:05.440
And... and... this!

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:09.110
Hold up. Why would I die?

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.400
Huh?

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:18.410
I don't plan on dying.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:23.660
Didn't I make you promise
to come to my recital?

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.080
Right, Yume?

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:38.220
Kano...

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.050
...it was an accident.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.220
Kano wasn't like that.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.690
Why do you look so big?

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:54.860
You never meant to break our promise.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.740
This... It's awful!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:07.920
It makes no difference
whether it's suicide or an accident.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:12.630
I just... don't want Kano to die!

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:19.050
Die? So that's why you came and found me.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:25.470
I should've got along with you better.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:36.490
Sorry, Yomogi. Can you give me more time?

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.990
Got it. I'm going ahead.

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.240
Okay.

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.990
We'll all be waiting for you.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:51.250
Everyone who vanished is stuck in the past

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:55.300
and it's up to me to bring them back!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.930
Money to last a lifetime...

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.720
A lifetime of--

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:05.970
Koyomi!

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:22.160
Huh? Supervisor?

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:25.620
Hurry! Help me pick it up!

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.950
Who cares? It's probably not real.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:33.920
And what if it is?! Argh, shit! Dammit!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:07.660
Yomogi.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.700
Let's go home, Koyomi.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:11.490
I...

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.500
Koyomi.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:30.470
Bastard! I'll kill you!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:45.610
Why... did you... betray us?

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:51.080
You Eugenicists are the ones
who betrayed the country.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:58.460
The country... wanted to
get rid of... us <i>kaiju </i>users.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:02.510
They were just... using us.

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:08.100
Why do you care...
about a country... like that?

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:14.180
It's not the country I care about.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.270
Prin... cess.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:26.860
That person... taught me...

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:31.990
Promises, love, and...

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.620
Gauma! This is no time to die!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:43.010
The Eugenicists revive in 5,000 years
and are trying to erase our world!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:47.010
Our present time is getting wiped out!

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:59.100
Yomogi, you're my lifesaver after all.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.110
Let's go back to our "now."

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:12.120
Knight, let's go back to our world!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.830
I didn't need help.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:22.340
It's embarrassing at home,
so I sang here a lot.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.750
I never knew.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.880
Yume, didn't you hate me?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.130
That's not true!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.470
You're always so agreeable.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:36.140
Yume, you know what people want to hear.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:39.390
That's not... true.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:45.360
I was always envious of that.

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:48.860
I wished I was more like you.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:52.280
That's why I pushed you away.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.530
Huh?

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:59.580
In high school, I decided to
join the club and try to change.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.880
I might've been spinning my wheels,

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:07.090
but Futaba was real nice to me.

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:10.430
Then you should've relied on him more.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:17.390
Yeah, but I didn't want to be a bother.
Maybe I tried too hard.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:20.980
So, please don't blame him.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:23.400
Okay.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:27.650
Make sure you rely on people.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:31.570
Lately, I'm getting much better at it.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.740
I see.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.700
I kinda envy you after all.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:48.510
Should I really go back to my own time?

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:50.720
Suit yourself, right?

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.300
You always say that.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:00.680
Hey, look!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:10.740
Thanks, Sis.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.250
Sorry I'm late!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.670
Welcome back, Minami.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:28.670
Hi.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:34.220
You back, Yume?
That <i>kaiju </i>took us into our pasts.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:38.600
So let's give it a big thank you!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:41.850
Dynazenon! Battle...

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.650
...Go!

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:47.560
Knight!

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.610
Right!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:06.330
We have to hurry!
The whole world will disappear!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:10.210
But what about the people
trapped in the <i>kaiju</i>?!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:16.340
If you beat the <i>kaiju </i>and disable
its power, all the people should return!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.680
Then let's beat the <i>kaiju</i>...

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:22.850
...and get back our "now"!

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:32.070
All together!

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:33.070
Right!

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:16.530
Super Dragon King Kaiser Gridknight!

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:27.080
Now!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.460
Powering up Dyna Saber!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.300
Here it goes!

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:37.760
Kaiser Knight Circular!

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:55.900
You worried me sick, Senpai. You okay?

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.690
I guess.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:21:00.610
So, you were betrayed
by the country you served?

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:02.320
Now I'm hungry from worrying so much.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:04.330
I can't remember every damn thing.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.330
Me, too.

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:08.250
Right? Let's grab something to eat!

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:09.500
But... I thought I'd
get to meet her again.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:11.130
Like <i>takoyaki</i>, maybe?

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.130
Huh?

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:13.960
I'm starving!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.460
Hmm?!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.460
Us, too.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:16.840
Wanna go eat?

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:18.590
Absolutely!

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.970
Huh? Where's Minami?

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:27.850
♬ The blue skies that cover... ♬

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.160
Captain!

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.330
Shoot, I collapsed from hunger.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:49.480
♬ Now, ♬

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:47.290
Again?!

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.120
Again?

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:49.580
Didn't I mention it?

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:54.380
♬ go and soar! ♬

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:54.380
The first time we met,
Gauma fell over from hunger.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:55.540
Really?

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:56.800
Just leave him behind.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:22:06.180
♬ On the winds called hope. ♬

00:21:56.800 --> 00:21:58.130
We should.
